# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ProVoice: models, datasets and training artifacts are NOT committed.
# The distraction models live on the Hugging Face Hub
# (maco018/in-car-distraction-yolo26) and are downloaded at runtime.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights (pulled from Hugging Face / auto-downloaded by Ultralytics)
#*.pt
# Training datasets (downloaded from Kaggle, rebuilt by scripts/build_statefarm_dataset.py)
/datasets/
# Ultralytics training run outputs (curves, checkpoints, logs)
/runs/
# Packaged model exports (uploaded to Hugging Face, not tracked here)
/exports/

