# Run outputs. Nothing under results/ is tracked, and committing it once already
# cost a pull that deleted two finished tau sweeps on the other machine (85e2494).
# Only *.pdf/*.png were ignored before, so CSVs and JSONs slipped in.
# Use `git add -f <path>` if a specific artifact ever needs to be versioned.
.RData
.Rhistory
docs/READMEImages/*
docs/local_docs/*
interviews/*.mp4
latex/
src/ProVoice/training_analysis/full_versions/

# results/: keep ONLY the summary tables the thesis tables (latex/scripts) and the
# notebooks read -- each sweep's *_results.csv / selected_*.json, the k-curve and
# paired CSVs, lodo_population.csv, committed_tau.json, user_study_checkpoints.csv.
# Everything else is regenerable or bulk: per-run epoch curves (runs/, ~1,400
# CSVs / 21 MB, only the sweep-analysis notebooks want them -- published as a
# release asset instead), pipeline smoke tests, plots, checkpoints.
# Whitelist form: exclude all, re-include directories so git keeps descending,
# then re-include the two summary types, then re-exclude the bulk subtrees.
results/**
!results/**/
!results/**/*.csv
!results/**/*.json
# the per-run epoch curves the two sweep-analysis notebooks read, zipped (see README)
!results/results_runs.zip
results/**/runs/
results/**/_smoke/
results/**/ckpt/
# superseded / draft runs (v2 and the non-draft sweeps are the cited ones)
results/anil_sweep/
results/anil_sweep_draft/
results/l2sp_sweep_draft/
results/arm_comparison/
results/arm_comparison_fullgrad/
results/pop_pipeline_adapt/
results/tau_quick/
results/within_driver/
